{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0074_1009_039kon", "source_sha256": "5b923b87b1eff176bcb0c4a514142ec27d17d96ac37929fb0f205905e10b23b4", "ja": "もう、{$P$}？\nそんな弱気なことを言ってたらダメよ！", "zh": "{$P$}你真是的，\n怎么可以说得这么不肯定呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
